      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGIC PLAYA (3) has had nine months off since he started favourite and placed from a wider barrier here on debut. Likely to have developed with maturity and should enjoy an economical run from this draw. UMBERTO (4) has come from the back row for second in his last two outings, missing by a neck at this circuit and distance then finishing only 1.3m off the winner last week at Pinjarra. Returns to the front row and a win looks imminent. JIMMYS RAINBOW (6) had been racing consistently before a well-deserved last-start win by 1.3 metres at Pinjarra. Could go on with it. COASTAL WAVE (5) is a filly by Downbytheseaside on debut. Won her latest trial so can be competitive.",
